SUMMARY:Smoky Mountains Wildlife Habitat Steward Training (Waynesville)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Smoky Mountains Wilderness Watch Chapter for three fun-filled days of renowned speakers and hands-on activities at the Haywood County Center in Waynesville! Come participate in NCWF’s Wildlife Habitat Steward Training program and become a certified wildlife habitat steward. This program will allow participants to increase their knowledge and ability to protect\, conserve\, and restore habitat for wildlife. Participants will also have the opportunity to engage with experts and fellow conservation enthusiasts about a variety of wildlife topics. Application is required and due by October 18th at noon \nAPPLY NOW
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/waynesville-whst/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
