SUMMARY:Village Greenway and Stream Cleanup (Concord)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Concord Wildlife Alliance Chapter for a litter sweep along Academy Branch\, a tributary of Buffalo Creek that runs along the Village Greenway. We will pick up litter in the stream and along the greenway. For every 25 pounds of litter collected\, NCWF plants native species throughout the state to promote healthy wildlife habitats\, mitigate climate change\, and buffer stormwater runoff and sediment loads in waterways. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/village-greenway-and-stream-cleanup-concord/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/VillageGreenwayStreamFinal-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
