SUMMARY:Invasive Removal Training and Workday (Durham)
DESCRIPTION:Want to rescue beautiful mature trees that are being smothered by invasive vines? Or clear out streambanks to make room for native plants that wildlife actually need? We’ll teach you how! Then we’ll all go out and conquer invasives in the park. NCWF Durham Wildlife Stewards Chapter and Keep Durham Beautiful will provide a this hands-on invasive plant removal training.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/invasive-removal-training-and-workday-durham-2/
