DESCRIPTION:Want to see more native plants and fewer invasive ones? Want more habitat for our birds and wildlife? Come learn how to make a major difference to the planet in just a few hours of work. NCWF Durham Wildlife Stewards Chapter and Keep Durham Beautiful will provide a this hands-on invasive plant removal workshop.  \nREGISTER HERE
