DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Concord Wildlife Alliance chapter to discover the weird and wonderful world of snakes and learn why they’re vital to our ecosystem. Bust common myths\, then meet our friendly\, non-venomous snake ambassador! \nREGISTER HERE
