SUMMARY:Holiday Wreath Workshop (Swannanoa)
DESCRIPTION:Join Swannanoa Valley WILD! and Bloom WNC at Hidden River Events in Swannanoa for an exciting wreath making workshop just in time for the holidays. Abigail at Bloom WNC will lead us step by step through the process of crafting a fresh and fragrant holiday wreath using fresh cut greens\, ribbon and natural embellishments. \nAll supplies will be provided and holiday beverages and pizza will be available for purchase. Bloom WNC is offering holiday bulbs for sale. 10% of the proceeds benefit Swannanoa Valley WILD! Participants will go home with a beautiful wreath and have the opportunity to learn more about the chapter. \nRegistration: Pre-registration is required to attend this workshop\, and the cost is $75 per person\, which includes all the materials you’ll need to create a wreath. Space is limited to 35 participants\, so please register early! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/holiday-wreath-workshop-swannanoa/
